<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">What You Think is What You See</span>: 
<br class="ltx_break">Driving Exploration in VLM Agents
via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
