<section id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">FrozenLake.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use a four-direction grid controller (Tab. <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ FrozenLake. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>); key environment settings are shown in Tab. <a href="#A2.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ FrozenLake. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
