<section id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Navigation.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tab. <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Navigation. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> enumerates movement and camera controls, while Tab. <a href="#A2.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Navigation. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> reports the rendering and control settings.</p>
</div>
