<section id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">PrimitiveSkill.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The agent issues parameterized manipulation commands (Tab. <a href="#A2.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ PrimitiveSkill. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>). We also list the per-turn action budget and horizon in Tab. <a href="#A2.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ PrimitiveSkill. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 10</span>: </span><span id="A2.T10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Action space for the PrimitiveSkill environment.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A2.T10.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T10.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
