<section id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">SVG Reconstruction.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The policy outputs free-form SVG markup as its action (Tab. <a href="#A2.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ SVG Reconstruction. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>); dataset and horizon details are provided in Tab. <a href="#A2.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ SVG Reconstruction. ‣ B.3 Environment Settings ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>.</p>
</div>
