<section id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">SVG Reconstruction.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The SVG reward is based on visual similarity; Tab. <a href="#A2.T18" title="Table 18 ‣ SVG Reconstruction. ‣ B.4 Reward Assignment ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> lists the full specification.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T18" class="ltx_table">
