<section id="A2.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.5 </span>Case Study</h3>

<div id="A2.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we show some cases from our four environments (Fig. <a href="#A2.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Navigation. ‣ B.4 Reward Assignment ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details. ‣ What You Think is What You See: Driving Exploration in VLM Agents via Visual-Linguistic Curiosity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.6 </span>Prompt Collection</h3>

<div id="A2.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section summarizes the prompt set used in our framework. We directly adopt the prompt templates from VAGEN  <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2025</a>)</cite> as our default prompts. For clarity and conciseness, we only present the prompts corresponding to Sokoban, Frozenlake, and Navigation in this section.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS6.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="88.84" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 88.84" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,88.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4682B4;" fill="#4682B4" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.98 L 0 79.86 C 0 84.82 4.02 88.84 8.98 88.84 L 468.4 88.84 C 473.36 88.84 477.38 84.82 477.38 79.86 L 477.38 8.98 C 477.38 4.02 473.36 0 468.4 0 L 8.98 0 C 4.02 0 0 4.02 0 8.98 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F0F8FF;" fill="#F0F8FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 8.98 L 1.11 33.25 L 476.27 33.25 L 476.27 8.98 C 476.27 4.63 472.74 1.11 468.4 1.11 L 8.98 1.11 C 4.63 1.11 1.11 4.63 1.11 8.98 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.92 40.98)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.37em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="45.51" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.82)" width="392.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS6.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.37em;">
<span id="A2.SS6.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS6.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Sokoban Training Prompt for World Model Strategy</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.92 14.06)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.63em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.23em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="451.51"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS6.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.63em;">
<span id="A2.SS6.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Sokoban</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">solver</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
